[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Dynamic-wave geometry kernel parity (SI units). A trunk backed up by a FIXED
outfall, a branch of drop manholes (invert offsets), an undersized branch that
surcharges and floods, a pipe that stays dry, and small systems draining to a
FREE and a NORMAL outfall. CIRCULAR and RECT_CLOSED conduits, one barrel each.

